 "nodes": {
  "660064052": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "You",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Moving in with Charlotte changed everything. Her world of luxury and adventure felt like a dream. She made me feel special and cherished.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-899059071": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "You",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "I can only hope that one day, Anna will find it in her heart to forgive me, to understand that while I chose a different path, I never stopped loving her.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "88952544": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "You",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Until then, I’ll carry the weight of this choice, knowing that every sunrise with Charlotte brings a new beginning.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "449206811": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "You",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "But this choice came with a cost. My relationship with Anna, my {M}, began to crumble. She saw my move as a betrayal, and our bond turned cold and distant.",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "-1439341433": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "You",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "Charlotte brought out a side of me I didn’t know existed—carefree, spontaneous, and deeply in love. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   }
  },
  "1700839753": {
   "kind": "text",
   "parent": -1,
   "actor": "You",
   "expressionName": "neutral",
   "text": "She made me feel special, cherished in a way that was intoxicating. ",
   "settings": {
    "m_Options": "FromSkin"
   },
